            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The following case is presented to illustrate the roentgenographic and clinical findings of a condition of interest to the orthopaedic surgeon. Initial history, physical findings, and roentgenographic examinations are presented along with the final histologic and differential diagnoses.</AbstractText>
